    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drag and Connect the Pieces!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690960/extras/c3dadee0eed53ea6e71bcfbee259233b.poster.avif?t=1712438681\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690960/extras/c3dadee0eed53ea6e71bcfbee259233b.webm?t=1712438681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690960/extras/c3dadee0eed53ea6e71bcfbee259233b.mp4?t=1712438681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Piece Link is a puzzle game that involves arranging blocks of various shapes to fill a playing field. The main objective of the game is to fit the blocks into a designated square so that all the blocks are used and there are no empty spaces. This requires strategic placement of the differently shaped pieces into a grid, aiming to form a complete square without any holes. The game is designed to be both entertaining and educational, challenging players' problem-solving skills and spatial reasoning.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drag and Connect the Pieces!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690960/extras/c3dadee0eed53ea6e71bcfbee259233b.poster.avif?t=1712438681\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690960/extras/c3dadee0eed53ea6e71bcfbee259233b.webm?t=1712438681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690960/extras/c3dadee0eed53ea6e71bcfbee259233b.mp4?t=1712438681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Piece Link is a puzzle game that involves arranging blocks of various shapes to fill a playing field. The main objective of the game is to fit the blocks into a designated square so that all the blocks are used and there are no empty spaces. This requires strategic placement of the differently shaped pieces into a grid, aiming to form a complete square without any holes. The game is designed to be both entertaining and educational, challenging players' problem-solving skills and spatial reasoning.",
    "short_description": "Connect the shapes to fit them together!",
